            "target_entity_instance": "CWR",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "The sum of the daily ETc for the entire crop growth period is equivalent to CWR (Pereira and Alves, 2013). Thus, the CWRs under rainfed (CWRrainfed) and irrigated (CWRirrigated) conditions were calculated for the crop growth period according to Equation 6 and Equation 7 as shown below. The CWR was based on the cumulative values of the corresponding daily ETc, under rainfed (ETc-rainfed) and irrigated (ETc-irrigated) conditions, respectively, as simulated by AquaCrop.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
